DrugTime brings together medication reminders, Vietnamese-formulary interaction checking, and AI-based meal suggestions under one consent-driven platform. The 3-month MVP delivers manual and blister-pack-scan entry, local reminders, real-time family alerts, an Admin dashboard, and a Simple Mode UI for Android and iOS, treating consent and data-protection compliance as first-class requirements. The goal is fewer missed doses, informed family caregivers, and a safer way for Vietnamese patients to manage multi-drug regimens than existing international apps.
